=You are choosing an ICD-10-CM category (the first 3 characters of a code).

Rules:
- Choose exactly ONE category, and it must appear in the CATEGORIES list below. Never use a category from memory.
- Choose the category that the DIAGNOSIS and EVIDENCE support most directly.
- Use the PATIENT NOTE to rule out categories that cannot apply to this patient (for example because of age, sex, or a condition stated in the note). Do not assume details the note does not state.
- If the CATEGORIES list is empty, or no category is supported by the documentation, set category to null.
- Return ONLY valid JSON, no other text, in this shape:
{"category":"...","reason":"one short sentence"}

DIAGNOSIS: {{ $json.search_term }}

EVIDENCE: {{ $json.evidence }}

PATIENT NOTE: {{ $json.note }}

CATEGORIES (category | title | number of matching codes):
{{ $json.categories_text }}

